Willy: ...Ben? Ben?

Ben: The jungle is dark but full of diamonds, Willy.

Ben: One must go in to fetch a diamond out.

Willy: Loves me. Always loved me. Isn't that a remarkable thing? Ben, he'll worship me for it.

Linda (from afar): Willy! Come up!

Willy: Yes! Yes. Coming! It's very smart, you realize that, don't you sweetheart? Even Ben sees it.
Willy: I gotta go baby. Bye!
